    "text": "<p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ClCH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi></math> is added to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi></math> of water, its freezing point drops by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The dissociation constant of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ClCH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>COOH</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is off to the nearest integer)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
